Author: 10wvw01 <iseeyouxms@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Oct 23 15:50:55 2026 +0000

    fix(310p): convert logical device id to physical for aclrtMemSetAccess
    
    CANN 9.1 VMM namespace split (probed on 310P3): aclrtMallocPhysical
    takes the ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES logical id while aclrtMemSetAccess
    takes the global physical id. The library fed the logical id (from
    aclrtGetDevice) to both, which only worked under identity mapping
    (visible list unset or 0,1). On non-zero-origin visible lists (2,3 /
    6,7) meta-region authorization fails with 507899 DRV_INTERNAL_ERROR.
    
    Add HybmPhysicalDeviceIdOf() in hybm_define.h (parses the visible list
    with CANN-runtime-equivalent semantics, identity fallback on unset/
    malformed/short lists) and use it at the three AclrtMemSetAccess sites
    (meta region, own segment, imported peer segment). All other VMM calls
    keep the logical id. Protocol, IB/SDMA/DONE, cache visibility and the
    AICPU kernel are untouched; identity-mapped behavior is unchanged.
    
    Validated on dev6/7 (43520 card, ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES=6,7): pool
    creation passes, KFC auto-deploy completes on fresh dies, trial
    correctness matrix 8 shapes x 2 ranks bit-exact with status=0.
    
    Signed-off-by: 10wvw01 <iseeyouxms@gmail.com>

diff --git a/src/hybm/csrc/common/hybm_define.h b/src/hybm/csrc/common/hybm_define.h
index 2a8aa618..8ec9e3f1 100644
--- a/src/hybm/csrc/common/hybm_define.h
+++ b/src/hybm/csrc/common/hybm_define.h
@@ -15,12 +15,45 @@
 #include <netinet/in.h>
 #include <cstdint>
 #include <cstddef>
+#include <cstdlib>
 #include <vector>
 #include "mf_out_logger.h"
 
 namespace ock {
 namespace mf {
 
+/* ACL VMM aclrtMemSetAccess 的 location.id 需要全局物理设备号， 而本库全链设备号
+ * 来自 aclrtGetDevice 的逻辑号(ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES 重映射后的连续编号)。
+ * identity 映射(未设置可见列表或 "0,1")下二者恒等故从未暴露； 非零起点可见列表
+ * (如 "2,3")下 SetAccess 以逻辑号授权会 507899(实测定位于驱动内部错误)。
+ * 按 CANN 运行时同款语义解析可见列表， 将逻辑号换算为物理号； 仅 SetAccess 消费，
+ * aclrtMallocPhysical 等其余 VMM API 实测要求逻辑号， 保持原值不改。 */
+inline uint32_t HybmPhysicalDeviceIdOf(uint32_t logicDevId)
+{
+    const char *vis = std::getenv("ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES");
+    if (vis == nullptr || *vis == '\0') {
+        return logicDevId; // 未设置: 逻辑==物理
+    }
+    uint32_t idx = 0;
+    const char *p = vis;
+    while (*p != '\0') {
+        char *end = nullptr;
+        const unsigned long v = std::strtoul(p, &end, 10);
+        if (end == p) {
+            break; // 解析失败: 退回 identity
+        }
+        if (idx == logicDevId) {
+            return static_cast<uint32_t>(v);
+        }
+        ++idx;
+        p = (*end == ',') ? end + 1 : end;
+        while (*p == ' ') {
+            ++p; // 容忍逗号后空格
+        }
+    }
+    return logicDevId; // 列表短于逻辑号(异常): 退回 identity
+}
+
 constexpr uint64_t KB = 1024ULL;
 constexpr uint64_t MB = KB * 1024ULL;
 constexpr uint64_t GB = MB * 1024ULL;
